		"section": "Start here",
		"heading": "Four behaviours that surprise people",
		"index": 7,
		"text": "Four behaviours that surprise people\n\n | What you see | Why\n\n | ok: true with savedTotal: 0 | Nothing durable was in it. Questions, small talk and repeats are supposed to store nothing.\n\n | A fact saved seconds ago is missing from recall | Extraction runs in the background. The response carries processing_note: \"A recent save is still processing — some facts may not appear yet.\"\n\n | context: \"\" on a perfectly good question | Either the gate declined to retrieve, or nothing scored high enough. Both are a 200, never an error.\n\n | A connected chat client stored nothing | The host model chose not to call the tool. Check History — a save you cannot find a receipt for did not happen."
