		"text": "Verify it end to end\n\nOne call confirms the credential, the memory space it resolves to, and what is in it:\n\ncurl -H \"authorization: Bearer $ITSUKI_API_KEY\" https://itsuki.app/v1/status\n\nA healthy account answers with live counts of memories, pages, details and events. If those numbers moved after step 2, the round trip works."
