		"text": "Connect Claude\n\nGive Claude at claude.ai a memory that outlives the conversation — added once as a remote custom connector, switched on per chat, and verified by a tool call that reports exactly which memory space it is attached to.\n\nBefore you start- An Itsuki project you can create keys in. If your role cannot, the button on Get started is replaced by a note reading \"Your role cannot create project keys.\" — see Projects & teams.\n- A Claude account. Remote custom connectors are a beta on Free, Pro, Max, Team and Enterprise, and a Free account is limited to one custom connector. Anthropic's custom-connector guide is the authority on current gating.\n- A computer browser. The Claude mobile apps cannot add a connector — add it once on a computer and it is there on your phone afterwards.\n- On Team or Enterprise, an Owner or Primary Owner: a custom connector is added for the whole organization, not per person."
