		"section": "Connect your tools",
		"heading": "Troubleshooting",
		"index": 3,
		"text": "Troubleshooting\n\n- /itsuki status says the key is not configured — ITSUKI_API_KEY is not visible to the pi process. Set it in the profile of the shell that launches pi, then restart pi.\n\n- Saves say \"queued\" rather than \"saved\" — Itsuki is unreachable or rate-limited; the span is spooled and delivers automatically. /itsuki doctor names the reason.\n\n- Saves succeed but recall is empty — extraction is asynchronous; allow a few seconds, then recall again."
