		"heading": "LangChain & LangGraph",
		"index": 1,
		"text": "LangChain & LangGraph\n\nFull LangChain & LangGraph page — the tailored integration, with its own setup, caveats and troubleshooting.\n\npip install langchain-mcp-adapters\n\nfrom langchain_mcp_adapters.client import MultiServerMCPClient\n\nclient = MultiServerMCPClient({\n    \"itsuki\": {\n        \"transport\": \"http\",\n        \"url\": \"https://itsuki.app/mcp\",\n        \"headers\": {\"Authorization\": \"Bearer YOUR_MCP_KEY\"},\n    }\n})\ntools = await client.get_tools()  # hand these to your LangGraph agent"
