		"heading": "CrewAI",
		"index": 2,
		"text": "CrewAI\n\nFull CrewAI page — the tailored integration, with its own setup, caveats and troubleshooting.\n\nThe MCP support lives in an extra — install crewai-tools[mcp], not plain crewai-tools, or MCPServerAdapter will not be exported.\n\npip install \"crewai-tools[mcp]\"\n\nfrom crewai_tools import MCPServerAdapter\n\nserver_params = {\n    \"url\": \"https://itsuki.app/mcp\",\n    \"transport\": \"streamable-http\",\n    \"headers\": {\"Authorization\": \"Bearer YOUR_MCP_KEY\"},\n}\n\nwith MCPServerAdapter(server_params) as tools:\n    agent = Agent(tools=tools, role=\"...\", goal=\"...\")"
