		"text": "Agno\n\nFull Agno page — the tailored integration, with its own setup, caveats and troubleshooting.\n\npip install agno\n\nfrom agno.tools.mcp import MCPTools, StreamableHTTPClientParams\n\nparams = StreamableHTTPClientParams(\n    url=\"https://itsuki.app/mcp\",\n    headers={\"Authorization\": \"Bearer YOUR_MCP_KEY\"},\n)\nasync with MCPTools(transport=\"streamable-http\", server_params=params) as mcp:\n    agent = Agent(tools=[mcp])"
