		"text": "Where to go next\n\nAuthentication & keysCredentials, scopes, and serving many end users.ErrorsEvery code the API returns, and what to do about it.Rate limits & quotasThe buckets, the bounds, and how to read them live.SDKsPython and JavaScript clients over the same endpoints."
