		"text": "Where to go next\n\nConnect a clientThe per-client setup steps, including the switch everyone forgets.Authentication & keysScopes, project roles, and what a credential can actually do.Correct a memory safelyRevisions, history, and rollback, with the REST equivalents.REST API referenceThe same operations from your own runtime, on your own schedule."
