		"heading": "Common options",
		"index": 10,
		"text": "Common options\n\nAccepted by every write and by search: user_id, memory_scope, source_scope, conversation_id, thread_id, source_id, idempotency_key, source, capture_density, rules. Beyond those:\n\n | Method | Also accepts\n\n | add, add_conversation | scope (\"full\", \"lastN\", \"topic\", \"summary\"), n, topic, recent_context, content_scope\n\n | search | topic, limit, recall_scope\n\n | turn | query, recall_scope\n\n | ingest | flush, delivery\n\nA key the method owns cannot be passed as an option — content, messages, mode and query are rejected rather than smuggled into the body."
