		"heading": "Scoping to a project",
		"index": 11,
		"text": "Scoping to a project\n\nProjects are metadata inside one account, not separate end users. recall_scope is one of \"global\" (the server default), \"project_only\" or \"project_then_global\".\n\nscope = {\"projectId\": \"atlas\", \"projectName\": \"Atlas\"}\n\nmemory.add(\"Atlas deploys from main.\", memory_scope=scope)\nmemory.search(\"How does Atlas deploy?\", memory_scope=scope, recall_scope=\"project_then_global\")"
