		"heading": "Open the Usage page",
		"index": 1,
		"text": "Open the Usage page\n\n- Open the profile menu.Top right of the dashboard.\n\n- Choose Usage & plan.What you should see: three filling bars — today's saves, this month's plan, and Huba messages — each with its numbers, and a countdown to the next 00:00 UTC reset under today's saves."
