		"section": "How-to guides",
		"heading": "A dashboard surface, not an API",
		"index": 7,
		"text": "A dashboard surface, not an API\n\nThere is no public Huba endpoint. API keys cannot call it, MCP clients cannot list it as a tool, and nothing you build on the API depends on it. If you want an assistant of your own answering from memory, that is what POST /v1/recall and POST /v1/turn are for.\n\nUsage & the daily allowanceThe bar that meters Huba, and how to request more.GET /v1/usageWhere the huba block reports today's messages.Rate limits and quotasThe published allowance figures, unauthenticated.QuickstartBuild the thing Huba can only explain."
